core.msg.ask_expired:
Core: your questions to the owner have had no answer for longer than {hours} h — the cards have gone stale, and nobody came back to the question after them:
{lines}
The owner's decision is still needed to move on — ask the question again through the AskUserQuestion form: the context in the question itself (they may not have opened the old card, "see above" will not work), one decision per question. The question is already settled (the owner answered otherwise, it settled by itself, the task is closed) or not needed — ask nothing and answer with a single "—": such an answer goes to no one. The core will not remind you of this question again.

